id: pm-jev-do7y
title: Select measured cost-sensitive abstention policies
description: "Let agents declare relative false-duplicate, wrong-type and missed-candidate costs over fixed labelled scores, then select a reproducible proposal-only abstention policy. Builds on PR #37."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T21:12:51.362Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T21:29:28.630Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Held-out synthetic/public labels yield reproducible cost/coverage curves; policies never weaken mandatory mutation checks.
parent: pm-jev-0w3q
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T21:13:21.060Z",codex-agent,"Overlap audit: searched current CLI 2026.10.21 and pinned SDK decision paths plus pm-rl, pm-context and pm-ops; no caller-cost abstention selector found. Existing pm-jev threshold/duplicate-quality calibration measures quality (PR #37, pm-jev-vouf); pm-rl trains/promotes policies and core stores decisions. This feature only selects proposal veto thresholds from fixed labelled observations, with held-out evaluation and no training, label edits or mutation authority. Acceptance: reproducible held-out synthetic/public cost/coverage curves; mandatory mutation checks remain independent and fail closed. Plan: typed bounded dataset, deterministic selection split, content-free receipt, CLI, example, real public snapshot replay in a non-git scratch tracker, targeted local checks and CI full npm/Bun gates."
  "2026-10-21T21:19:53.234Z",codex-agent,"Implementation: versioned typed fixed-score dataset and three relative penalties; 22-point bounded confidence grid; deterministic selection-only minimum empirical cost with content-free hashes and held-out diagnostics. CLI jev policy emits compact TOON/JSON or full counts; refusal codes include remedies and nonzero exit. SDK policy is a veto only, with explicit mandatory-check and eligibility verdicts. Targeted tests pass 5/5; targeted c8 for both new runtime modules is 100% statements/branches/functions/lines. No-git real SDK tracker test removes git/provider tools from PATH and verifies authoritative tracker hashes unchanged. Public receipt replay and behavioral revert proof are next."
  "2026-10-21T21:24:47.193Z",codex-agent,"Public replay passed: verified three public commit archives and 381 items in read-only non-git copies; restored two historical duplicate records and reconciled seven sampled pair labels/retrieval flags, with authoritative tracker hashes unchanged and no git on the SDK/CLI path. Replayed all 156 frozen PR #37 scores (150 selection, 6 held-out), zero model calls. Costs 1/10/1 select 0.70: selection cost 45, coverage 7/150; held-out cost 0, coverage 2/6. Costs 20/10/1 and 100/10/1 select 0.80: selection cost 46, coverage 4/150; held-out cost 1, coverage 1/6. Small correlated holdout, two positives, and unadjudicated negative controls limit conclusions; wrong-type costs have synthetic evidence only. Receipt: calibration/cost-policy-report-v1.json."
  "2026-10-21T21:24:52.371Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: temporarily replacing caller costs with fixed cheap-mistake costs made the cost-selection regression fail (exit 1, expected threshold 0.95). Separately removing only the mandatory-check veto made its guard regression fail (exit 1, expected mandatory_checks_failed). Restored the exact implementation after each mutant; feature suite returned to green. Broader targeted calibration/dedupe/type-guard run passed 53/53. Real host CLI JSON/TOON and refusal exit-code probes pass in a non-git SDK-initialized tracker with no git executable. Linked pm test ran all 7 feature tests successfully. PR #37 merged upstream during implementation; its deleted source branch will be refreshed via the PR head ref, merged locally and never pushed."
  "2026-10-21T21:29:27.898Z",codex-agent,"CI verified code head 52e2cfb342176edb1bcae44e83e2ad79d31710e7: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jev/actions/runs/39678766550 passed. Node 22 and 26 each passed full npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 295 tests per gate, zero failures, coverage 100% statements/branches/functions/lines with 25 required source files reported and unchanged thresholds. Fresh-checkout strict pm health and committed dist checks passed. Local typecheck, test typecheck, lint, docstrings (681 declarations), duplication (0%), build, public provenance and changelog checks passed. Local strict health separately reports existing ignored pm-github/host version skew covered by pm-jev-v2la, not reproduced in CI. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jev/pull/40 is ready for review; no merge or package release performed. Bot reviews skipped/manual-required are not approval. No new pm CLI/SDK defect identified. Claim released for orchestrator verification; item remains in progress."
